SUMMARY:Panigiri of Profitis Ilias\, Piskopio
LOCATION:Piskopio (Episkopio)\, Syros\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The hill village of Piskopio above Ermoupoli celebrates Profitis Ilias on 19-20 July with vespers and a panigiri that opens the Syros summer: island food\, wine\, violin and laouto in the square. Easy to reach by taxi from town.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/syros/#piskopio-episkopio-panigiri-of-profitis-ilias-piskopio
